=QUESTION: {{ $json.question }}
REPLY LANGUAGE: {{ $json.reply_language }} (answer, why and refusal text must all be in this language)
Answer ONLY this QUESTION. Earlier turns are only for resolving references such as "them" or "that year"; never repeat or reuse an earlier answer, and run_sql again for any number.

CONTEXT (retrieved, rank-ordered):
{{ $json.context }}

